                           </fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                         space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                         space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                         id="d95e23">
                              <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                 <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                              </fo:list-item-label>
                              <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:block>All existing copyright notices, or if one does not exist, a
        notice (hypertext is preferred, but a textual representation is
        permitted) of the form: "Copyright © [$date-of-document] Eclipse
        Foundation, Inc. &lt;&lt;url to this license&gt;&gt;"</fo:block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:list-item-body>
                           </fo:list-item>
                        </fo:list-block>
                        <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.maximum="5pt">Inclusion of the full text of this NOTICE must be provided. We
    request that authorship attribution be provided in any software,
    documents, or other items or products that you create pursuant to the
    implementation of the contents of this document, or any portion
    thereof.</fo:block>
                        <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.maximum="5pt">No right to create modifications or derivatives of Eclipse
    Foundation documents is granted pursuant to this license, except anyone
    may prepare and distribute derivative works and portions of this document
    in software that implements the specification, in supporting materials
    accompanying such software, and in documentation of such software,
    PROVIDED that all such works include the notice below. HOWEVER, the
    publication of derivative works of this document for use as a technical
    specification is expressly prohibited.</fo:block>
                        <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.maximum="5pt">The notice is:</fo:block>
                        <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.maximum="5pt">"Copyright © [$date-of-document] Eclipse Foundation. This software
    or document includes material copied from or derived from [title and URI
    of the Eclipse Foundation specification document]."</fo:block>
                        <fo:block font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-size="9pt"
                                  line-height="11pt"
                                  space-before="6pt">Disclaimers</fo:block>
                        <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.maximum="5pt">THIS DOCUMENT IS PROVIDED "AS IS," AND THE COPYRIGHT HOLDERS AND
      THE ECLIPSE FOUNDATION MAKE NO REPRESENTATIONS OR WARRANTIES, EXPRESS OR
      IMPLIED, INCLUDING, BUT NOT LIMITED TO, WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY,
      FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, NON-INFRINGEMENT, OR TITLE; THAT THE
      CONTENTS OF THE DOCUMENT ARE SUITABLE FOR ANY PURPOSE; NOR THAT THE
      IMPLEMENTATION OF SUCH CONTENTS WILL NOT INFRINGE ANY THIRD PARTY
      PATENTS, COPYRIGHTS, TRADEMARKS OR OTHER RIGHTS.</fo:block>
                        <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.maximum="5pt">THE COPYRIGHT HOLDERS AND THE ECLIPSE FOUNDATION WILL NOT BE
      LIABLE FOR ANY DIRECT, INDIRECT, SPECIAL OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES
      ARISING OUT OF ANY USE OF THE DOCUMENT OR THE PERFORMANCE OR
      IMPLEMENTATION OF THE CONTENTS THEREOF.</fo:block>
                        <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.maximum="5pt">The name and trademarks of the copyright holders or the Eclipse
      Foundation may NOT be used in advertising or publicity pertaining to
      this document or its contents without specific, written prior
      permission. Title to copyright in this document will at all times remain
      with copyright holders.</fo:block>
                        <fo:block font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-size="12pt"
                                  line-height="14pt"
                                  space-before="8pt">Preface</fo:block>
                        <fo:block font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-size="12pt"
                                  line-height="14pt"
                                  space-before="8pt">Implementation Requirements</fo:block>
                        <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.maximum="5pt">An implementation of a Specification: (i) must fully implement the
    Specification including all its required interfaces and functionality;
    (ii) must not modify, subset, superset or otherwise extend the OSGi Name
    Space, or include any public or protected packages, classes, Java
    interfaces, fields or methods within the OSGi Name Space other than those
    required and authorized by the Specification. An implementation that does
    not satisfy limitations (i)-(ii) is not considered an implementation of
    the Specification and must not be described as an implementation of the
    Specification. "OSGi Name Space" shall mean the public class or interface
    declarations whose names begin with "org.osgi" or any recognized
    successors or replacements thereof. An implementation of a Specification
    must not claim to be a compatible implementation of the Specification
    unless it passes the Technology Compatibility Kit ("TCK") for the
    Specification.</fo:block>
                        <fo:block font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-size="12pt"
                                  line-height="14pt"
                                  space-before="8pt">Feedback</fo:block>
                        <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.maximum="5pt">This specification can be downloaded from the OSGi Documentation web
    site:</fo:block>
                        <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.maximum="5pt">
                           <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">
                              <fo:basic-link external-destination="url(https://docs.osgi.org/specification/)">
                                 <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                            font-family="inherit"
                                            letter-spacing="inherit"
                                            hyphenate="inherit">
                                    <fo:inline hyphenate="false">https://docs.osgi.org/specification/</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                        <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.maximum="5pt">Comments about this specification can be raised at:</fo:block>
                        <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.maximum="5pt">
                           <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">
                              <fo:basic-link external-destination="url(https://github.com/osgi/osgi/issues)">
